        {
          "id": "name",
          "label": "Name",
          "default": "Hero"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<section class=\"art-set\"><h2>Hero</h2><p>Walks in two frames.</p><div class=\"art-frames\"><figure class=\"art-cell\"><svg class=\"art-sprite\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Idle\"><path class=\"c-ink\" d=\"M5 1h6v1h-6zM4 2h1v1h-1zM11 2h1v1h-1zM3 3h1v1h-1zM12 3h1v1h-1zM3 4h1v1h-1zM6 4h1v1h-1zM9 4h1v1h-1zM12 4h1v1h-1zM3 5h1v1h-1zM6 5h1v1h-1zM9 5h1v1h-1zM12 5h1v1h-1zM3 6h1v1h-1zM12 6h1v1h-1zM4 7h1v1h-1zM11 7h1v1h-1zM5 8h6v1h-6zM4 9h1v1h-1zM11 9h1v1h-1zM3 10h1v1h-1zM12 10h1v1h-1zM3 11h1v1h-1zM5 11h1v1h-1zM10 11h1v1h-1zM12 11h1v1h-1zM4 12h1v1h-1zM11 12h1v1h-1zM4 13h1v1h-1zM7 13h2v1h-2zM11 13h1v1h-1zM4 14h3v1h-3zM9 14h3v1h-3z\" /><path class=\"c-white\" d=\"M5 2h6v1h-6zM4 3h8v1h-8zM4 4h2v1h-2zM7 4h2v1h-2zM10 4h2v1h-2zM4 5h2v1h-2zM7 5h2v1h-2zM10 5h2v1h-2zM4 6h8v1h-8zM5 7h6v1h-6z\" /><path class=\"c-blue\" d=\"M5 9h6v1h-6zM4 10h8v1h-8zM4 11h1v1h-1zM6 11h4v1h-4zM11 11h1v1h-1zM5 12h6v1h-6zM5 13h2v1h-2zM9 13h2v1h-2z\" /></svg><figcaption>Idle</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"art-cell\"><svg class=\"art-sprite\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Step\"><path class=\"c-ink\" d=\"M5 1h6v1h-6zM4 2h1v1h-1zM11 2h1v1h-1zM3 3h1v1h-1zM12 3h1v1h-1zM3 4h1v1h-1zM6 4h1v1h-1zM9 4h1v1h-1zM12 4h1v1h-1zM3 5h1v1h-1zM6 5h1v1h-1zM9 5h1v1h-1zM12 5h1v1h-1zM3 6h1v1h-1zM12 6h1v1h-1zM4 7h1v1h-1zM11 7h1v1h-1zM5 8h6v1h-6zM4 9h1v1h-1zM11 9h1v1h-1zM3 10h1v1h-1zM12 10h1v1h-1zM3 11h1v1h-1zM5 11h1v1h-1zM10 11h1v1h-1zM12 11h1v1h-1zM4 12h1v1h-1zM11 12h1v1h-1zM3 13h1v1h-1zM6 13h1v1h-1zM9 13h1v1h-1zM12 13h1v1h-1zM3 14h3v1h-3zM10 14h3v1h-3z\" /><path class=\"c-white\" d=\"M5 2h6v1h-6zM4 3h8v1h-8zM4 4h2v1h-2zM7 4h2v1h-2zM10 4h2v1h-2zM4 5h2v1h-2zM7 5h2v1h-2zM10 5h2v1h-2zM4 6h8v1h-8zM5 7h6v1h-6z\" /><path class=\"c-blue\" d=\"M5 9h6v1h-6zM4 10h8v1h-8zM4 11h1v1h-1zM6 11h4v1h-4zM11 11h1v1h-1zM5 12h6v1h-6zM4 13h2v1h-2zM10 13h2v1h-2z\" /></svg><figcaption>Step</figcaption></figure></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "art-tile",
      "name": "Tile with its repeat",
      "group": "Art",
      "platform": "art",
      "description": "A tile (svg.art-sprite.tile, its pixels in a g with an id) and beside it .art-repeat showing it 3 by 3 with use, to see its seams.",
      "props": [
        {
          "id": "name",
          "label": "Name",
          "default": "Grass"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<section class=\"art-set\"><h2>Grass</h2><p>The ground the hero walks on.</p><div class=\"art-frames\"><figure class=\"art-cell\"><svg class=\"art-sprite tile\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Grass\"><g id=\"tile-grass\"><path class=\"c-green\" d=\"M0 0h16v1h-16zM0 1h1v1h-1zM2 1h5v1h-5zM8 1h5v1h-5zM14 1h2v1h-2zM0 2h16v1h-16zM1 3h1v1h-1zM3 3h2v1h-2zM6 3h2v1h-2zM9 3h3v1h-3zM13 3h2v1h-2z\" /><path class=\"c-leaf\" d=\"M1 1h1v1h-1zM7 1h1v1h-1zM13 1h1v1h-1z\" /><path class=\"c-dirt\" d=\"M0 3h1v1h-1zM2 3h1v1h-1zM5 3h1v1h-1zM8 3h1v1h-1zM12 3h1v1h-1zM15 3h1v1h-1zM0 4h16v1h-16zM0 5h2v1h-2zM3 5h8v1h-8zM12 5h2v1h-2zM15 5h1v1h-1zM0 6h16v1h-16zM0 7h6v1h-6zM7 7h9v1h-9zM0 8h16v1h-16zM0 9h1v1h-1zM2 9h7v1h-7zM10 9h4v1h-4zM15 9h1v1h-1zM0 10h16v1h-16zM0 11h5v1h-5zM6 11h10v1h-10zM0 12h16v1h-16zM0 13h10v1h-10zM11 13h3v1h-3zM15 13h1v1h-1zM0 14h1v1h-1zM2 14h14v1h-14zM0 15h16v1h-16z\" /><path class=\"c-brown\" d=\"M2 5h1v1h-1zM11 5h1v1h-1zM14 5h1v1h-1zM6 7h1v1h-1zM1 9h1v1h-1zM9 9h1v1h-1zM14 9h1v1h-1zM5 11h1v1h-1zM10 13h1v1h-1zM14 13h1v1h-1zM1 14h1v1h-1z\" /></g></svg><figcaption>Grass</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"art-cell\"><svg class=\"art-repeat\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"192\" height=\"192\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Grass repeated\"><use href=\"#tile-grass\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" /><use href=\"#tile-grass\" x=\"16\" y=\"0\" /><use href=\"#tile-grass\" x=\"32\" y=\"0\" /><use href=\"#tile-grass\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\" /><use href=\"#tile-grass\" x=\"16\" y=\"16\" /><use href=\"#tile-grass\" x=\"32\" y=\"16\" /><use href=\"#tile-grass\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" /><use href=\"#tile-grass\" x=\"16\" y=\"32\" /><use href=\"#tile-grass\" x=\"32\" y=\"32\" /></svg><figcaption>3 by 3, for seams</figcaption></figure></div></section>"
    }
  ]
